<title>USA: Washington Federal raises qtly dividend.</title>
<headline>Washington Federal raises qtly dividend.</headline>
<dateline>SEATTLE 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The board of directors of Washington Federal Inc, parent of Washington Federal Savings, increased the bank's quarterly dividend by about five percent to $0.23 per share from $0.22 per share.</p>
<p>The dividend will be payable July 25 to common stockholders of record on July 9.</p>
